BEGIN:VCALENDAR\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:5fb9a63d6382fc858d1636c7c4299abe\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104650Z\r\nSUMMARY:Tapestry: A Festival of Belonging\r\nDESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, October 24th\, join the Alexandria Choral Society\r\n  for Tapestry: A Festival of Belonging\, a performance that will weave tog\r\n ether the voices\, languages\, and traditions of our diverse community int\r\n o one richly patterned evening of music.In addition to pieces sung in Engl\r\n ish\, Spanish\, and Amharic\, this program will feature a new work by awar\r\n d-winning composer Nebal Maysaud\, whose music bridges Western and Middle \r\n Eastern traditions\, as well as poetry from Alexandria's own Poet Laureate\r\n \, Cristi Donoso\, giving voice to the immigrant experience that has shape\r\n d this city for generations.Tickets for this concert are pay-what-you-can\\r\n , with a suggested price of $30. Get your tickets today and join the Alexa\r\n ndria Choral Society as we celebrate what makes us many and what makes us \r\n one.\r\nURL:https://www.alexandriachoralsociety.org/tapestry\r\nDTSTART:20261024T160000\r\nDTEND:20261024T173000\r\nLOCATION:101 Callahan Drive\r\nGEO:38.807295;-77.064361\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=101 Callahan Drive;X-APPLE-\r\n RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=George Washington Masonic National Memorial:geo:38.80729\r\n 5,-77.064361\r\nORGANIZER;CN=Alexandria Choral Society;DIR=https://www.alexandriachoralsoci\r\n ety.org/tapestry:mailto:boxoffice@alexandriachoralsociety.org\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/202\r\n 6/10/Alexandria-Choral-Society_5CE26298-9B5A-5A7A-A33C55B07F543975_events-\r\n 150x150.png\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:6dad0fc940d5274c92093883cf578471\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104653Z\r\nSUMMARY:Swedish Coffee Culture Event\r\nDESCRIPTION:Join the Alexandria Sister Cities Committee at Buzz Bakeshop (9\r\n 01 Slaters Lane) to learn about Swedish Coffee culture (fika)! As part of \r\n Alexandria's sister city relationship with Helsingborg\, Sweden\, this eve\r\n nt celebrates a beloved Swedish tradition. In Sweden\, fika is part of eve\r\n ryday life and a big part of their culture. Fika is when you take time for\r\n  a colleague or friend and have a coffee (or tea)\, ideally enjoyed with a\r\n  yummy baked treat. So much more than enjoying the coffee and cookie\, fik\r\n a allows you to slow down and appreciate the good things in life. Many Swe\r\n des consider it almost essential to fika everyday (many companies add a cl\r\n ause to contracts stating that employees are entitled to fika breaks!). Kr\r\n istina's Swede treats will give a fika introduction with traditional pastr\r\n ies. A limited number of fika-boxes will also be available for purchase ($\r\n 20). They are listed as a seperate event in the Alexandria Shop event page\r\n . A fika-box includes two cinnamon buns\, two chocolate cuts\, and two ras\r\n pberry caves. The cinnamon bunds have gluten\, lactose\, and eggs. If you \r\n have allergies\, please let us know.\r\nURL:https://shop.alexandriava.gov/EventPurchase.aspx?dateselected=10/25/202\r\n 6\r\nDTSTART:20261025T150000\r\nDTEND:20261025T170000\r\nLOCATION:901 Slaters Lane\r\nGEO:38.821599;-77.047699\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=901 Slaters Lane;X-APPLE-RA\r\n DIUS=49;X-TITLE=Buzz Bakeshop:geo:38.821599,-77.047699\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/10/IMG_3293_28A84AA9-EF43-91F9-76C3D1D3A095E3BC_events-150x150.jpe\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:c05a5f3928641e03b32de745791c4a8f\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104644Z\r\nSUMMARY:Lost Boy Cider: Fall Fest 2026\r\nDESCRIPTION:Lost Boy Cider's biggest day of the year is back. Fall Fest fil\r\n ls Alexandria's cidery and its lot with live music\, local makers\, barbec\r\n ue and cider on Saturday\, October 24\, from 12 to 6 PM.- 20 local makers:\r\n  ceramics\, jewelry\, art\, candles\, crochet\, flowers\, sweets and more-\r\n  Live music all afternoon from three acts- Whole hog BBQ\, served from 12:\r\n 30 until it's gone- Petting zoo from 12:30 to 2:30- 100 free pumpkins for \r\n kids (reserve ahead on the event page)- Cider at an outdoor bar and in the\r\n  tasting roomFree admission. Family friendly\, leashed dogs welcome\, rain\r\n  or shine. Free parking on site\; the lot fills by early afternoon. 21+ to\r\n  drink.\r\nURL:https://www.lostboycider.com/event/fall-fest-2026/\r\nDTSTART:20261024T120000\r\nDTEND:20261024T180000\r\nLOCATION:317 Hooffs Run Drive\r\nGEO:38.798715;-77.063270\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=317 Hooffs Run Drive;X-APPL\r\n E-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Lost Boy Cider:geo:38.798715,-77.063270\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/10/IMG_1352_DFA7BBB0-E119-2407-D838BF0166ADDA4C_events-150x150.jpe\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:d2f0c7d9e6c1e5d9429e3412056054f4\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104645Z\r\nSUMMARY:Lost Boy Cider: Fall Fest 2026\r\nDESCRIPTION:Lost Boy Cider's biggest day of the year is back. Fall Fest fil\r\n ls Alexandria's cidery and its lot with live music\, local makers\, barbec\r\n ue and cider on Saturday\, October 24\, from 12 to 6 PM.- 20 local makers:\r\n  ceramics\, jewelry\, art\, candles\, crochet\, flowers\, sweets and more-\r\n  Live music all afternoon from three acts- Whole hog BBQ\, served from 12:\r\n 30 until it's gone- Petting zoo from 12:30 to 2:30- 100 free pumpkins for \r\n kids (reserve ahead on the event page)- Cider at an outdoor bar and in the\r\n  tasting roomFree admission. Family friendly\, leashed dogs welcome\, rain\r\n  or shine. Free parking on site\; the lot fills by early afternoon. 21+ to\r\n  drink.\r\nURL:https://www.lostboycider.com/event/fall-fest-2026/\r\nDTSTART:20261024T120000\r\nDTEND:20261024T180000\r\nLOCATION:317 Hooffs Run Drive\r\nGEO:38.798715;-77.063270\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=317 Hooffs Run Drive;X-APPL\r\n E-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Lost Boy Cider:geo:38.798715,-77.063270\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/10/IMG_1352_E01B0184-AEBD-075E-CAE0205E712AC7D2_events-150x150.jpe\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:8d4ffa16e0d3f3c5d54468a3a6ee1445\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104644Z\r\nSUMMARY:Halloween Improv Comedy Show with the Auxiliary\r\nDESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of Halloween themed\, made-up-on-the-spo\r\n t improv comedy! We'll be calling on you to give us suggestions for a tota\r\n lly unique show that'll never be seen again!Show is 18+ recommended. We pe\r\n rform free shows for the Alexandria\, VA and surrounding community. Donati\r\n ons help us rent space\, supply drinks\, and defray other costs!\r\nURL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/halloween-improv-comedy-show-with-the-auxi\r\n liary-tickets-1979247762337?aff=valx\r\nDTSTART:20261024T200000\r\nDTEND:20261024T220000\r\nLOCATION:201 S. Washington Street\r\nGEO:38.803764;-77.047586\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=201 S. Washington Street;X-\r\n APPLE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Alexandria History Museum at The Lyceum:geo:38.803\r\n 764,-77.047586\r\nORGANIZER;CN=The Auxiliary Improv;DIR=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/hallowee\r\n n-improv-comedy-show-with-the-auxiliary-tickets-1979247762337?aff=valx:mai\r\n lto:theauxiliaryimprov@gmail.com\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/10/Oct26_C86540C1-EE2D-0CBC-EF0230393C69CEE8_events-150x150.jpg\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:f5d4893e6ca64dbf092769c159dbaef7\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104701Z\r\nSUMMARY:Mount Purrnon Cat Café & Wine Bar: Paws & Potions\r\nDESCRIPTION:Join witchy friends to celebrate a night of cats and magic. Wit\r\n h things getting more expensive\, it's the purrfect time to make a money-d\r\n rawing jar. Tickets include all supplies\, mulled wine\, and an hour of fe\r\n line familiars.\r\nURL:https://www.mtpurrnoncatcafe.com/events\r\nDTSTART:20261030T183000\r\nDTEND:20261030T200000\r\nLOCATION:109 S. Alfred Street\r\nGEO:38.804889;-77.049482\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=109 S. Alfred Street;X-APPL\r\n E-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Mount Purrnon Cat Café & Wine Bar:geo:38.804889,-77.0\r\n 49482\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/10/MPCCWB-Paws-Potions-2026_8BB0ADD5-9DFA-1AA6-8A48859E32593297_events-\r\n 150x150.jpg\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:01904eaacb70aaa6cb44ccc67b4103e7\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104657Z\r\nSUMMARY:Mount Purrnon Cat Café & Wine Bar: Halloween Trivia With Cats\r\nDESCRIPTION:Test your knowledge of all things spooky &amp\; trivial during \r\n Trivia Night with Cats! Where else can you do trivia in Old Town with doze\r\n ns of furry beasties?\r\nURL:https://www.mtpurrnoncatcafe.com/events\r\nDTSTART:20261029T180000\r\nDTEND:20261029T200000\r\nLOCATION:109 S. Alfred Street\r\nGEO:38.804889;-77.049482\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=109 S. Alfred Street;X-APPL\r\n E-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Mount Purrnon Cat Café & Wine Bar:geo:38.804889,-77.0\r\n 49482\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/202\r\n 6/10/halloween-trivia-2026_8B76056C-CFF8-71FA-6D9FEE8CC6BD642A_events-150x\r\n 150.png\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:19876e15043b70f215ef8a3357d6ff68\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104652Z\r\nSUMMARY:Woodlawn & Pope-Leighey House: Countdown to the Holidays\r\nDESCRIPTION:Join us at Woodlawn &amp\; Pope-Leighey House for Countdown to \r\n the Holidays\, a FREE site-wide autumn celebration packed with family-frie\r\n ndly activities\, hands-on craft workshops\, live music\, and local histor\r\n y!\nWe thank the Fairfax250 Commission for its support of this program\, p\r\n art of Fairfax County's commemoration of the 250th anniversary of the Amer\r\n ican Revolution.\nSite-Wide Highlights:\n\nHistoric House Tours: Explore b\r\n oth Woodlawn and Pope-Leighey House with open house access and guided arch\r\n itecture tours sharing how these two iconic properties connect.\nDescendan\r\n t Voices &amp\; Genealogy: Hear directly from Woodlawn Descendants\, build\r\n  your own family tree\, and take part in interactive genealogy workshops.\\r\n nNew Exhibit Access: Be among the first to view Friends Gather Here&#x97\;\r\n an exhibit exploring Woodlawn's transformation from a plantation to an ant\r\n i-slavery colony before the Civil War&#x97\;and join curatorial staff for \r\n spotlight tours.\nNeedlepoint Workshops: Learn needlepoint tips from Nelly\r\n 's Needlers\, discover their historic preservation efforts\, and get early\r\n  inspiration for the 2027 Woodlawn Needlework Show.\nFamily &amp\; Childre\r\n n's Fun: Build natural fairy houses on the lawn and enjoy story time at th\r\n e Frank Lloyd Wright-designed Pope-Leighey House.\nCommunity Partner Hub: \r\n Connect with neighboring historic and genealogical organizations at our pa\r\n rtner tabling center.\n\n1:00 PM &#x96\; 4:00 PM: Arcadia's Fall Funtacula\r\n r!\nHead over to the farm for an afternoon of fall festivities! Play games\r\n \, create seasonal crafts\, help plant garlic\, meet the farm's resident c\r\n hickens\, listen to live music\, and enjoy a vibrant autumn day outdoors.\r\nURL:https://www.woodlawnpopeleighey.org/upcomingevents/2026/10/countdown-5d\r\n jam-fnbaa-hjdsm-w3bbw-ylcyj-shb29-ry4br-2nppn-b6hf3-rjlmc-gwhy8-a459b\r\nDTSTART:20261024T100000\r\nDTEND:20261024T160000\r\nLOCATION:9000 Richmond Highway\r\nGEO:38.718222;-77.137099\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=9000 Richmond Highway;X-APP\r\n LE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Woodlawn & Pope-Leighey House:geo:38.718222,-77.13709\r\n 9\r\nORGANIZER;CN=Woodlawn & Pope-Leighey House;DIR=https://www.woodlawnpopeleig\r\n hey.org/upcomingevents/2026/10/countdown-5djam-fnbaa-hjdsm-w3bbw-ylcyj-shb\r\n 29-ry4br-2nppn-b6hf3-rjlmc-gwhy8-a459b:mailto:woodlawn@savingplaces.org\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/202\r\n 6/10/Countdown-to-the-Holidays-6-_44B3C875-7974-4712-833FE9AB417E75F6_even\r\n ts-150x150.png\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:ca3919bab77c59c2e8dc7d6c7bdf3128\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104651Z\r\nSUMMARY:Vola's Dockside Grill: The Old Town Women's Crawl + Dance Party\r\nDESCRIPTION:The Old Town Alexandria Women's Crawl: Empower Your Health is a\r\n  fun\, interactive afternoon featuring local restaurants on lower King St\\r\n , wellness activations\, a primal scream\, raffles\, food &amp\; drink spe\r\n cials\, and an after-dance party. Come solo or with friends and enjoy a da\r\n y of connection\, empowerment\, and fun while supporting The Breast Cancer\r\n  Collective. This event is brought to you by Del Ray Psych &amp\; Wellness\r\n  and Shrinks on Tap Podcast.\r\nURL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/the-old-town-alexandria-womens-crawl-dance\r\n -party-tickets-2001677315735\r\nDTSTART:20261024T130000\r\nDTEND:20261024T200000\r\nLOCATION:101 N. Union Street\r\nGEO:38.804552;-77.040020\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=101 N. Union Street;X-APPLE\r\n -RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Vola's Dockside Grill and Hi-Tide Lounge + Other Restau\r\n rants:geo:38.804552,-77.040020\r\nORGANIZER;CN=Del Ray Psych & Wellness;DIR=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/the-\r\n old-town-alexandria-womens-crawl-dance-party-tickets-2001677315735:mailto:\r\n info@shrinksontap.com\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/202\r\n 6/10/INSTA1_AC584B48-CE72-4741-66F7C6DF70C959EE_events-150x150.png\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:592686194a994dd69862e58410f881ee\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104658Z\r\nSUMMARY:Arielle Shoshana Perfume: Experimental Perfume Club Blending Master\r\n class\r\nDESCRIPTION:The Experimental Perfume Club x Arielle Shoshana Blending Maste\r\n rclass returns!\nThe Blending Masterclass is Experimental Perfume Club's s\r\n ignature hands-on fragrance experience\, designed to educate\, inspire\, \r\n and immerse guests in the Art of Blending by EPC.\nLed by our founder\, ma\r\n ster perfumer Emmanuelle Moeglin\, participants are guided through the pri\r\n nciples of fragrance composition\, exploring EPC's award-winning collectio\r\n n of Blendable Eau de Parfum\, understanding the science behind scent stru\r\n cture\, and learning how to create a balanced perfume.\nEach guest will bl\r\n end their own bespoke fragrance\, resulting in a unique\, personalized sce\r\n nt to take home in a beautifully labelled bottle.\nA celebration of creati\r\n vity\, craftsmanship\, and individuality\, this collaboration between Expe\r\n rimental Perfume Club and Arielle Shoshana offers guests a rare opportunit\r\n y to create their own olfactory masterpiece.\nSpaces are limited. Early bo\r\n oking is strongly recommended. Please arrive promptly at the beginning of \r\n your ticketed time slot\, as the masterclass will begin at the scheduled t\r\n ime regardless of late arrivals.\nIf you will be driving\, we strongly rec\r\n ommend factoring in extra time to find parking. Here are the closest park\r\n ing lots!\nIf you have ordered a ticket and need to switch to a different \r\n time slot\, please email us at info@arielleshoshana.com. We will do our be\r\n st to reschedule you if possible.\r\nURL:https://www.arielleshoshana.com/products/masterclass\r\nDTSTART:20261030T113000\r\nDTEND:20261030T193000\r\nLOCATION:313 Cameron Street\r\nGEO:38.805831;-77.042831\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=313 Cameron Street;X-APPLE-\r\n RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=Arielle Shoshana Perfume:geo:38.805831,-77.042831\r\nORGANIZER;CN=Arielle Shoshana Perfume;DIR=https://www.arielleshoshana.com/p\r\n roducts/masterclass:mailto:info@arielleshoshana.com\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/10/Screenshot-2026-10-01-103447_9F0C69D8-8E36-459A-B8D92751896C6224_eve\r\n nts-150x150.jpg\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:919eff555a7167f34073798a269772d1\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104627Z\r\nSUMMARY:Royally Spooked Halloween Pop-up at Royal Restaurant\r\nDESCRIPTION:This October\, Royal's patio is going spooky. Step onto our hau\r\n nted patio for Royally Spooked\, a Halloween pop-up filled with eerie déc\r\n or\, festive drinks\, and spooky-season vibes all month long. Gather your \r\n favorite ghosts and ghouls\, grab a cocktail\, and settle in for a royally\r\n  spooky good time at Royal Restaurant.\r\nURL:https://www.opentable.com/booking/experiences-availability?rid=660178&r\r\n estref=660178&experienceId=789237&lang=en-US&ot_source=Website&ot_campaign\r\n =Royal+Halloween+Pop-Up\r\nDTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024\r\nLOCATION:730 North Saint Asaph Street\r\nGEO:38.812738;-77.044362\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=730 North Saint Asaph Stree\r\n t;X-APPLE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=:geo:38.812738,-77.044362\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/10/Royally-Spooked-Event-Square_AD292D82-01CA-1817-BE8D9BAA60A97D8A_eve\r\n nts-150x150.jpg\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:77a936748af1d2dcf82fbf4ac0193416\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104627Z\r\nSUMMARY:Royally Spooked Halloween Pop-up at Royal Restaurant\r\nDESCRIPTION:This October\, Royal's patio is going spooky. Step onto our hau\r\n nted patio for Royally Spooked\, a Halloween pop-up filled with eerie déc\r\n or\, festive drinks\, and spooky-season vibes all month long. Gather your \r\n favorite ghosts and ghouls\, grab a cocktail\, and settle in for a royally\r\n  spooky good time at Royal Restaurant.\r\nURL:https://www.opentable.com/booking/experiences-availability?rid=660178&r\r\n estref=660178&experienceId=789237&lang=en-US&ot_source=Website&ot_campaign\r\n =Royal+Halloween+Pop-Up\r\nDTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025\r\nLOCATION:730 North Saint Asaph Street\r\nGEO:38.812738;-77.044362\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=730 North Saint Asaph Stree\r\n t;X-APPLE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=:geo:38.812738,-