55Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104609Z\r\nSUMMARY:George Washington's Mount Vernon: Beer Garden at the Mount Vernon I\r\n nn Restaurant\r\nDESCRIPTION:Enjoy craft beer\, wine\, and a special food menu during happy \r\n hour available Tuesday to Friday from 4:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. at the histor\r\n ic Mount Vernon Inn Restaurant.\nWe are proud to feature local breweries a\r\n s part of our rotating selection of craft beers.\r\nURL:https://www.mountvernonrestaurant.com/beer-garden/?utm_source=visitalex\r\n andria.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=mv_inn_beergarden_ec\r\nDTSTART:20261030T160000\r\nDTEND:20261030T190000\r\nLOCATION:3200 Mount Vernon Memorial Highway\r\nGEO:38.710402;-77.087024\r\nX-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=3200 Mount Vernon Memorial \r\n Highway;X-APPLE-RADIUS=49;X-TITLE=George Washington's Mount Vernon:geo:38.\r\n 710402,-77.087024\r\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\r\nATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitalexandria.com/wp-content/uploads/20\r\n 26/05/customers-cheers-beer-garden-mount-vernon_4774DDFB-4991-474C-85C9B7F\r\n 8FDD2DB6B_events-150x150.jpg\r\nBEGIN:VALARM\r\nACTION:DISPLAY\r\nDESCRIPTION:Reminder: the event starts in an hour!\r\nTRIGGER;RELATED=END:-PT1H\r\nEND:VALARM\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:71dcdfb3aec2659e8ac26719648dc147\r\nDTSTAMP:20261024T224355Z\r\nLAST-MODIFIED:20261022T104606Z\r\nSUMMARY:Patriots Path: A Revolutionary War Encampment\r\nDESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the daily life of soldiers\, military offic\r\n ers\, and the camp followers who traveled with the army as you explore a R\r\n evolutionary War encampment. \nAt this hands-on attraction\, you can touc\r\n h the items inside the soldiers' tents and officer's tent\, wash clothes i\r\n n the laundry yard\, and examine cooking utensils used by camp followers.\r\n  \nSee two daily programs about enlisting in General Washington's army an\r\n d how soldiers prepared their meals while traveling. This attraction is ma\r\n de possible thanks to Americana Cor